  "body": "There is a limited window of opportunity to secure this fabulous property as the current owners are looking to downsize and have their eye on another property. \r\n\r\nDesigned with euphoric living in mind this substantial family home situated three houses back from the sea on a 716sqm (approx) freehold title in one of Auckland's most desirable streets is simply exquisite. Excellent architectural design and quality craftsmanship have created this awe inspiring property offering open plan kitchen, living and dining areas which flow seamlessly to an outdoor entertaining area and swimming pool which is perfectly orientated for the sun and privacy. \r\n\r\nSuperb attention to detail with purpose-built, bespoke fittings and finishes found inside and out, generous stud height and low maintenance grounds. Comprising formal and informal living and dining areas, four bedrooms, three stylish bathrooms plus an additional living area that is currently being utilised as a fifth bedroom. Spacious three car garaging and plenty of off street parking.\r\n\r\nProperties as sought after as this are rare and tightly held, this is an opportunity not to be missed.",
